### Page contents (PDCA / schema)

| Section | Focus |
|--------|--------|
| **Purpose** | Chrome outside `main` must show border, shadow, or ≥0.06 luminance delta vs main; aligned with `det-chrome-boundary.check.js` |
| **Passing signals** | `.forge-sidebar` + `var(--forge-border)`, `.site-header` `border-bottom`, `.ks-site-footer-region` top rule, pseudo cues |
| **Failing signals** | `missing-boundary`, inline `border-*: none`, flat shared `var(--forge-bg)` |
| **Before / After** | Handbook shell: `site-header`, **Ksr** `aside.forge-sidebar`, `doc-main`, **Ksf** `.ks-site-footer-region`, `forge-card`, `nav-link`, `ks-doc-breadcrumb` |
| **Evidence** | `chromeBoundaryReport`, remediation steps, `analyze-website-ux.mjs` |
| **Related rules** | `DET.LANDMARKS.REQUIRED`, `DET.LAYOUT.GRID_CONSISTENCY`, `DET.APP.PERSISTENT_CHROME`, nav rules, AI workflow/hierarchy |

